Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: runtest.c
Line: 1753
Function: htmlTokenizerTest
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: The result of xmlMalloc(size + 1) is not checked. If allocation fails (returns NULL), the subsequent fread(data, 1, size, input) writes to a NULL pointer, causing a crash.

Source context:
